# Crontab for the `watchdog` service (supercronic, TZ=Europe/Berlin, cwd /app).
# The hunter itself is a long-running loop in the `hunter` service, not a cron job.

# Crawler watchdog: Telegram + ntfy alert when the hunter has not completed a
# crawl cycle for 30 min; crawler-down copied to ntfy (the hunter alerts
# Telegram itself). Stale after 1 h without a clean run.
*/15 * * * * /app/deploy/run-job.sh watchdog 3600 -- python scripts/crawler_watchdog.py

# Alert once if a job above has not succeeded within its max age.
*/30 * * * * /app/deploy/run-job.sh --check-stale
